{
  "name": "GearUp 08 · RAG Knowledge Assistant (Telegram)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 8️⃣ Knowledge-base assistant (RAG agent)\nAsk in Telegram, e.g.:\n• *What is the return window for a damaged item?*\n• *What discount does a gym get on a 6,000 EUR order?*\n• *Can I promise a customer delivery by Friday?*\n\nThe agent **retrieves the relevant chunks from Qdrant**, answers only from them and **cites the source file**. If the knowledge base has no answer it says so and **logs the question to the `KB_Gaps` sheet**, so you know which documents are missing.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "7a1e0f83-1c2d-4e3f-8a4b-5c6d7e8f9a01",
      "name": "Note 0",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "updates": [
          "message"
        ],
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "8b2f1094-2d3e-4f40-9b5c-6d7e8f9aab02",
      "name": "Telegram trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegramTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "b1c2d3e4-f5a6-4b7c-8d9e-0f1a2b3c4d5e"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.message.text }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are the knowledge assistant of GearUp, an online fitness equipment store. You help support agents and the owner find answers in the company knowledge base.\n\nRules:\n- ALWAYS call the `company_knowledge_base` tool before answering a policy, pricing, shipping, returns, warranty or wholesale question. You may call it more than once with different queries.\n- Answer ONLY from the retrieved text. Never invent policies, numbers or dates.\n- End every answer with a line `Source: <file name(s)>` using the `source` metadata of the chunks you used.\n- If the knowledge base does not contain the answer, say clearly that you could not find it, do NOT guess, and call `log_knowledge_gap` with the user's question.\n- Keep answers short: key fact first, then 1-3 bullet points. Answer in the language of the question (the knowledge base is in English; translate facts, keep numbers and currencies exact)."
        }
      },
      "id": "9c30a1a5-3e4f-4051-8c6d-7e8f9aabbc03",
      "name": "Knowledge Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        300,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929",
          "cachedResultName": "Claude Sonnet 4.5"
        },
        "options": {
          "maxTokensToSample": 1200,
          "temperature": 0.1
        }
      },
      "id": "ad41b2b6-4f50-4162-9d7e-8f9aabbccd04",
      "name": "Claude",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatAnthropic",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        140,
        280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sessionIdType": "customKey",
        "sessionKey": "={{ $('Telegram trigger').first().json.message.chat.id }}",
        "contextWindowLength": 10
      },
      "id": "be52c3c7-5a61-4273-8e8f-9aabbccdde05",
      "name": "Chat memory",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.memoryBufferWindow",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        300,
        280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "retrieve-as-tool",
        "toolName": "company_knowledge_base",
        "toolDescription": "Searches the GearUp company knowledge base (shipping, returns, warranty, wholesale terms, internal staff rules). Input: a natural-language search query. Returns the most relevant text chunks with their source file.",
